  "source": "// mem-link 示例：索引式链表（next/prev 是池下标，不是指针）\n#pragma pack(push, 4)\n\ntypedef struct {\n    uint16_t magic;   // 0xBEEF\n    uint16_t head;    // 头节点在池中的下标\n    uint16_t tail;\n    uint16_t count;\n} Header;\n\ntypedef struct {\n    int16_t  next;     // 下一个节点的池下标，-1 = 结束\n    int16_t  prev;\n    uint16_t flags;\n    uint16_t refcount;\n    char     name[12];\n    uint32_t ts;\n} Entry;\n\n#pragma pack(pop)\n\n// 位域 + 紧凑布局（1 字节）\ntypedef struct {\n    uint8_t kind  : 3;\n    uint8_t dirty : 1;\n    uint8_t flags : 4;\n    uint8_t refs;\n} Meta;\n",
